sequenceDiagram
  participant A as A Platform (ESP32 + bridge)
  participant C as C Vision
  participant D as D Auto Controller
  participant E as E Control Station
  C->>D: vision/ball (seq n), plan/route (ball_seq n)
  C->>E: vision/ball, plan/route
  D->>D: check state, mode, freshness, maze_id
  D->>A: ai/target_tilt or control/target_tilt (ball_seq n)
  alt gate open (playing, selected mode, game/state < 300 ms)
    A->>A: bridge → TargetTilt → ESP32 → servos
  else gate closed
    A->>A: nothing forwarded, ESP32 command timeout levels the plate
  end
  A->>D: platform/state (measured tilt)
  A->>E: platform/state
  D->>E: ai/status
